Package: AITrace
Title: Industrial AI Governance, Assurance and Continuous Improvement
Version: 0.4.1
Authors@R: person("Hubert", "Boulic", email = "hb914162@gmail.com",
                  role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A governance-first framework for industrial AI systems.
    AITrace treats the governed object as the complete AI system (model,
    data, prompts, retrieval, tools, guardrails, runtime, evidence, risks,
    incidents, improvements, evaluations, decisions and changes) rather
    than a single model artifact. Version 0.4.0 adds observation,
    monitoring_spec, drift_assessment and detection_signal recording on
    the frozen 0.3.0 decision/change layer. Measurements are supplied;
    the package never fabricates health or drift scores. Version 0.4.1 is
    a hardening pass on that recording layer: directional drift semantics,
    timestamp/version validation, a declarative monitoring_spec default,
    stricter detection/drift traceability, and registry_import()
    re-validation.
